msgstr "Lista över (åtgärd); högst 100 objekt"

msgid ""
"Enter YAML or JSON in the add-on's :guilabel:`Workflow` field. The API "
"accepts the same structure as the ``workflow`` member of ``configuration``. "
"The :download:`JSON Schema </specs/automation.schema.json>` describes this "
"representation independently of the editor. Unknown keys are rejected."
msgstr ""
"Ange YAML eller JSON i tilläggets fält :guilabel:`Arbetsflöde`. API:t "
"accepterar samma struktur som medlemmen ``workflow`` i ``configuration``. "
":download:`JSON Schema </specs/automation.schema.json>` beskriver "
"representationen oberoende av redigeraren. Okända nycklar avvisas."
